WP17 security and no-claim proof

Commands:

- cargo test -p ocentra-parent-agent-core activity_store_browser_intervention
- cmd /c npm run test:managed-browser-intervention

Negative proof:

- Legacy intervention rows without the new fields default to no action/audit refs, no evidence refs, and not-delivered.
- Legacy managed rows can infer managed-session exact URL proof only from managed session id plus requested/observed URL; unmanaged rows stay not-claimed/unavailable.
- Managed-browser harness launches isolated proof profiles under a temp Ocentra proof root and cleans them up after the run.
- Evidence stores `devtoolsEndpoint: loopback-redacted`; raw debugger WebSocket URLs are not written to the proof JSON.
- The allowed-control navigation stays unblocked across Chrome, Firefox, and Edge.
- AI is not an action authority in WP17. Parent policy/rule match drives the action proof.

Non-claims:

- No unmanaged exact URL claim.
- No default-profile attach claim.
- No broad OS browser blocking claim.
- No native app, native game scene, cloud-streamed frame analysis, or per-message/reel control claim.
